111	/* Overlay text is stamped into the canvas just for the push, then the pixels
112	 * under it are put back. Drawing on the display after the push flickered,
113	 * because the next push wiped the text for a moment. The canvas must end up
114	 * as the hack left it, since hacks draw incrementally. M5Canvas wraps the
115	 * canvas buffer so M5GFX's fonts can draw into it; the DejaVu fonts are 1-bit,
116	 * so only pure black and white are written (the same in either byte order). */
